[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0010","text":"辛苦了——我说……\n你在干什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0020","text":"树里，辛苦了。\n现在我们在找蛋呢。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0030","text":"是寻蛋游戏哦！\n树里酱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0040","text":"原来如此，毕竟是复活节嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0050","text":"树里酱也一起来怎么样！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0060","text":"嗯，好啊！那我也加入吧。\n要找到几个才行？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0070","text":"十个装的……\n一盒…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0080","text":"一盒……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0090","text":"明明记得买回来了的，\n但哪里都找不到……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31300500_03_0100","text":"那也算寻蛋游戏……吗……？"}]
